REPLACE THIS FILE WITH YOUR AIVEN CA CERTIFICATE

To get your ca.pem:
1. Go to Aiven Console → Your MySQL Service
2. Click "Overview" tab
3. Download the CA Certificate
4. Replace this file's contents with the certificate

The certificate looks like:
-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
MIIEQTCCAqmgAwIBAgIU...
...base64 encoded data...
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
